#: components/overlays/how-to-play-overlay.tsx:718
msgid "Achievements are the other kind. Nothing can take one back: they are achieved once and yours for good, and they are measured against you rather than against anybody else — so they are there to be collected whether or not your score is ever good enough for a board.\n"
"\n"
"There are dozens, and they ask for all sorts of things."
msgstr "Úspěchy jsou ten druhý druh. Nikdo ti je nevezme: dosáhneš jich jednou a máš je napořád. A poměřuješ se u nich sám se sebou, ne s ostatními — takže se dají sbírat, i kdyby tvoje skóre na žebříček nikdy nestačilo.\n"
"\n"
"Jsou jich desítky a chtějí po tobě kdeco."

